        "slideId": "s3",
        "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
        "text": "Stage 4 serves authorized consumers behind Role-Based Access Controls and immutable SIEM audit trails. Stage 5 transitions aging tables to cold archival object storage such as Amazon S3 Glacier to optimize cloud storage economics. Finally, Stage 6 executes end-of-life purging or GDPR Article 17 cryptographic erasure when retention limits expire.",
