        "slideId": "s4",
        "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
        "text": "Pillar 3 captures automated attribute lineage via OpenLineage. Pillar 4 guarantees Disaster Recovery via the three-two-one backup rule. Pillar 5 enforces least-privilege access via Role-Based Access Controls and dynamic column masking. And Pillar 6 prevents duplicated curation work through searchable FAIR metadata catalogs.",
