        "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
        "text": "The Bronze tier serves as an append-only immutable landing zone storing raw JSON payloads and Kafka streams schema-on-read. If a downstream transformation bug appears months later, Bronze allows deterministic replay from raw byte truth. The Silver tier applies schema-on-write contracts, deduplication, and ACID transactions via Delta Lake or Apache Iceberg in columnar Parquet. Finally, the Gold tier exposes curated star schemas and ML feature matrices tuned for sub-second model serving.",
