        "slide": 8,
        "slideId": "s8",
        "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
        "text": "Under United States HIPAA law, health datasets require de-identifying eighteen Safe Harbor identifiers with deterministic tokenization and strict audit logs. Under the EU AI Act, high-risk systems require auditable dataset provenance and Datasheets documentation. And under California CCPA, catalogs must support granular sensitive field tagging and consumer opt-out workflows.",
