        "slideId": "s16",
        "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
        "text": "Let us summarize the five core ethical engineering takeaways from Lesson 3.2. First: Operationalize ethics into deterministic code contracts—Rawlsian maximin floors and bounded disparity checks. Second: Avoid the proxy label trap—never substitute healthcare spend or historical arrest records for true human need.",
